       "source": "UniProtKB",
       "id": "P11183"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Interacts with GLDC (By similarity). The glycine cleavage system is composed of four proteins: P (GLDC), T (GCST), L (DLD) and H (GCSH)"
    }
